{"unit_id": "Raven-Jackdaw__dsh-film-analysis#feature-1", "repo": "Raven-Jackdaw/dsh-film-analysis", "commit": "9ba482664d79542102ac7fc5247c35fa37c7fbf9", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-film-analysis 的功能「图像指标测量」：读取单张影视画面并返回尺寸、画幅比、平均亮度、RMS 对比度、色温倾向、饱和度、边缘密度和亮度直方图。通过 film_image_metrics 工具传入图片绝对路径。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:44-50"]}
{"unit_id": "Raven-Jackdaw__dsh-film-analysis#feature-2", "repo": "Raven-Jackdaw/dsh-film-analysis", "commit": "9ba482664d79542102ac7fc5247c35fa37c7fbf9", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-film-analysis 的功能「镜头自动检测」：根据视频画面变化检测镜头切换，返回各镜头起止时间和时长；可用阈值调整切点数量。通过 film_scene_detect 工具输入视频路径。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:307-322"]}
{"unit_id": "Raven-Jackdaw__dsh-film-analysis#feature-3", "repo": "Raven-Jackdaw/dsh-film-analysis", "commit": "9ba482664d79542102ac7fc5247c35fa37c7fbf9", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-film-analysis 的功能「逐镜头 AI 分析」：对视频片段抽取代表帧并计算片段运动、亮度和声音信息，再调用 DSH 会话默认模型生成八维视听语言分析。通过 film_ai_analyze_shot 提供片段起止时间。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:385-405", "lib/ai.js:213-238"]}
{"unit_id": "Raven-Jackdaw__dsh-film-analysis#feature-4", "repo": "Raven-Jackdaw/dsh-film-analysis", "commit": "9ba482664d79542102ac7fc5247c35fa37c7fbf9", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-film-analysis 的功能「画面标注导出」：在图片上绘制构图辅助线、景别框、轴线、视线或运动箭头及文字标签，并输出 PNG。通过 film_image_overlay 输入比例坐标标注。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:143-181"]}
{"unit_id": "Raven-Jackdaw__dsh-film-analysis#feature-5", "repo": "Raven-Jackdaw/dsh-film-analysis", "commit": "9ba482664d79542102ac7fc5247c35fa37c7fbf9", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-film-analysis 的功能「本地中文转写」：将视频音轨转换为带时间码的台词片段，供后续镜头分析使用。通过 film_transcribe 输入视频路径；该增强路径要求本机 Python 与 faster-whisper。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:521-540"]}
